        "last_commit_message": "Post each finished Butler check's summary into the main Butler chat (#1327)\n\nA finished Nebula-wide check, and a project check with a summary or a\ndecision, appends one assistant message (author butler, not operator\ninput, starts no turn) to the main Butler chat: time, scope, host\nproject, result and a link to the child chat. Checks Core saw no activity\nin and whose reply starts with 'No change' post nothing. Each case is\nqueued once on ButlerGlobalState and delivered by the worker that owns the\ntarget chat's project. The target is a Core setting next to the check\ninterval, with recorded fallbacks.\n\nPublic commit guard skipped at the operator's explicit request (urgent);\nthe diff was scanned for emails, IPs, private paths and ids before commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
